return static function(App$app):array{$out=[];$check=static function(string$n,bool$v)use(&$out):void{$out[$n]=$v;};$db=$app->database();$admin=(int)$db->query('SELECT u.id FROM users u JOIN user_roles ur ON ur.user_id=u.id JOIN roles r ON r.id=ur.role_id WHERE r.slug="admin" LIMIT 1')->fetchColumn();$app->session()->set('auth_user',['id'=>$admin,'name'=>'Admin','email'=>'admin@test','status'=>'active','roles'=>['admin'],'permissions'=>['*']]);$paths=['student admission letter'=>'/admin/students/admission-letter','student ID cards'=>'/admin/students/id-cards','student basic list'=>'/admin/students/basic-list','student credentials'=>'/admin/students/logins','student promotions'=>'/admin/students/promotions','student report card'=>'/admin/students/report-card','employee job letter'=>'/admin/employees/job-letter','employee credentials'=>'/admin/employees/logins','salary pay'=>'/admin/salary/pay','salary slips'=>'/admin/salary/receipt','homework'=>'/admin/homework','exam create'=>'/admin/exams/create','exam setup'=>'/admin/exams/setup','exam marks'=>'/admin/exams/marks','exam results'=>'/admin/exams/results','class test marks'=>'/admin/class-tests/marks','class test results'=>'/admin/class-tests/results','admission report'=>'/admin/reports/admissions','contact report'=>'/admin/reports/contacts','certificates'=>'/admin/certificates','messaging'=>'/admin/communication/messaging'];foreach($paths as$name=>$path){$response=$app->run(new Request([],[],[],['REQUEST_METHOD'=>'GET','REQUEST_URI'=>$path]));$check('bound view '.$name.' renders',$response->status()===200&&!str_contains($response->content(),'data-demo-submit'));}
$i=(int)$db->query('SELECT id FROM institutes ORDER BY id LIMIT 1')->fetchColumn();$w=new WorkflowRepository($db);$home=$db->query('SELECT h.id,h.homework_date,h.teacher_id,h.class_id,h.subject_id,h.homework_text FROM homework h JOIN classes c ON c.id=h.class_id WHERE c.institute_id=:i ORDER BY h.id DESC LIMIT 1',['i'=>$i])->fetch();if($home){$updated=$w->updateHomework($i,(int)$home['id'],['date'=>$home['homework_date'],'teacher_id'=>$home['teacher_id'],'class_id'=>$home['class_id'],'subject_id'=>$home['subject_id'],'text'=>$home['homework_text'].' updated','attachment'=>null]);$check('homework update persists',$updated&&str_ends_with((string)$db->query('SELECT homework_text FROM homework WHERE id=:id',['id'=>$home['id']])->fetchColumn(),' updated'));}
